contribution.requiredTests:
Run the narrow check with `./scripts/pg-iterate.sh <file>` and the final repository lane with `./scripts/validate.sh`. On a cold cache, run `./scripts/lake-locked.sh exe cache get` first.

The pull request includes:
- the exact theorem, definition, executable check or refutation changed;
- the verified commit SHA and the exact Lean and Lake commands;
- successful output from the narrow check and the required repository validation;
- an assumption audit: new axioms, admitted facts, named residuals, stronger hypotheses and imported results relevant to the claim;
- the source files and declarations that carry the result;
- a reproducible counterexample or generated artifact when applicable;
- an honest statement of what remains open.

